---
/**
 * Site-wide soft-launch notice. Sits above the Nav in normal document flow
 * (not sticky) — it scrolls away with the page, and the sticky Nav below it
 * pins flush to the true viewport top once you scroll past it.
 */
---

<div class="announce">
  <p class="announce__text">
    During soft launch. Early users get
    <strong>30% off</strong> their engagement.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .announce {
    background: var(--c-accent);
    padding: 0.5rem var(--s-gutter);
  }

  .announce__text {
    max-width: var(--w-max);
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--t-small);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .announce__text strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
